summary: 'Completed the three Phase 3 delegations that close the core build before raw creator testing. Delegation A wired Quill/Lux/Iris as invokable Claude Code agents via .claude/agents/*.md files and reconciled persona.yaml + system-prompt.md tool references against the real MCP surface. Delegation B built the minimum-viable atelier_mind_map_query MCP tool (~11KB) for local-only slot resolution with portal gate registration, plus reconciled two stale skill markdown files. Delegation C added atelier init command for first-run creator setup (Ambient/Explicit choice, learning-mode.yaml write, scaffold call-through, mind-map directory + README, optional git init). Workspace tests now: schema 80, mcp 175, cli 217 — all passing. Compliance clean (post anchor re-materialization). The team is now ready for raw end-to-end content-creation testing.'
