learnings:
  - 'Persona-cited MCP tools didn''t match the real surface — 7 names didn''t exist, 1 misnamed. Resolution: rewrite persona references to real tool names; audio pipeline (silence-trim/transcribe/captions) routed to CLI shell-out rather than duplicating as MCP tools.'
  - Claude Code agents load from .claude/agents/<name>.md with mcp__<server>__<tool> frontmatter convention (matched settings.local.json pattern). Inert markdown wrappers around persona system prompts — no new packaging mechanism needed.
  - Adding imports at the top of an existing file shifts line numbers and breaks aspect anchors. Both Delegation B and C touched files with anchors — B's drift was real (had to null content hashes for re-materialization); C avoided it because the cli.ts anchors weren't line-pinned. Future builders should preemptively check for anchor drift when inserting imports.
  - Mind-map stub is intentionally minimal — pure read against local disk with extension-based kind matching, mtime sort, optional hint filtering. Phase 4 will add ingestion/indexing/curation; the stub form unblocks Lux and Iris slot binding without committing to a storage layer.
